		<profileDesc>
			<abstract>
				<p>A severe vulnerability in the DNS resolver&apos;s cache is exposed here, introducing a new type of attack, termed DNS CacheFlush. This attack poses a significant threat as it can easily disrupt a resolver&apos;s ability to provide service to its clients.</p>
